{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/3ba1460c738ce9269033d63c2af0fea4.poster.avif?t=1762421506\" width=615 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/3ba1460c738ce9269033d63c2af0fea4.webm?t=1762421506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Experience the adrenaline-fueled intensity of modern drone warfare like never before.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FPV Kamikaze Drone Simulator</i> is a high-octane action game that puts you in direct control of cutting-edge FPV drones on deadly kamikaze missions. Navigate realistic battlefields, outmaneuver enemy defenses, and strike high-value targets with surgical precision. Whether you're an action junkie or a fan of flight simulators, this game delivers a fresh, immersive perspective on tactical combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the controls of anti-tank kamikaze drones, perform top-down grenade strikes, and fly night missions using infrared and night vision tech. Every mission challenges your reflexes, tactics, and decision-making as you engage enemy infantry, tanks, artillery, and fortified bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Early Access version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 5 combat maps + a dedicated training zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Anti-tank kamikaze and grenade-drop drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Night vision and infrared camera support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Day/night missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Realistic flight &amp; explosion physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Enemy tanks, IFVs, artillery, and infantry</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re just getting started. Upcoming updates will bring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 New drone types with unique capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26 Dynamic weather systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Smarter enemy AI and more complex missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Building and vehicle destruction systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Community-suggested content</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built With Realism in Mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a simulation grounded in real-world tech. We aim to create the most authentic FPV drone warfare experience available, and community feedback is a vital part of that journey. Expect regular updates, surveys, and open discussion with the developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! I\u2019m an indie developer from the Kyrgyz Republic. Many players ask where I\u2019m from, so here it is. This game is a <strong>neutral project</strong> \u2014 it does not support <strong>any side in current military conflicts</strong> (e.g., Russia-Ukraine, Israel-Palestine). My goal is to build a realistic simulator that explores the capabilities of modern drones without taking political stances.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3804950?t=1762421506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/7bf5ecf3d7523a6dd08d647f734e484c41c9069b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762421506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/92052781222bf9619f89bba77ace76774e5e5ca6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762421506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/92052781222bf9619f89bba77ace76774e5e5ca6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762421506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/3ba1460c738ce9269033d63c2af0fea4.poster.avif?t=1762421506\" width=615 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/3ba1460c738ce9269033d63c2af0fea4.webm?t=1762421506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Experience the adrenaline-fueled intensity of modern drone warfare like never before.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FPV Kamikaze Drone Simulator</i> is a high-octane action game that puts you in direct control of cutting-edge FPV drones on deadly kamikaze missions. Navigate realistic battlefields, outmaneuver enemy defenses, and strike high-value targets with surgical precision. Whether you're an action junkie or a fan of flight simulators, this game delivers a fresh, immersive perspective on tactical combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the controls of anti-tank kamikaze drones, perform top-down grenade strikes, and fly night missions using infrared and night vision tech. Every mission challenges your reflexes, tactics, and decision-making as you engage enemy infantry, tanks, artillery, and fortified bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Early Access version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 5 combat maps + a dedicated training zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Anti-tank kamikaze and grenade-drop drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Night vision and infrared camera support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Day/night missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Realistic flight &amp; explosion physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Enemy tanks, IFVs, artillery, and infantry</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re just getting started. Upcoming updates will bring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 New drone types with unique capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26 Dynamic weather systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Smarter enemy AI and more complex missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Building and vehicle destruction systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Community-suggested content</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built With Realism in Mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a simulation grounded in real-world tech. We aim to create the most authentic FPV drone warfare experience available, and community feedback is a vital part of that journey. Expect regular updates, surveys, and open discussion with the developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! I\u2019m an indie developer from the Kyrgyz Republic. Many players ask where I\u2019m from, so here it is. This game is a <strong>neutral project</strong> \u2014 it does not support <strong>any side in current military conflicts</strong> (e.g., Russia-Ukraine, Israel-Palestine). My goal is to build a realistic simulator that explores the capabilities of modern drones without taking political stances.</p>","developers":["FPV"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/db15ddbbf5aa0924593f3d4f0655b3b52c0645e1/header.jpg?t=1762421506","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"FPV Kamikaze Drone Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 8.1, Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> RC transmitter is recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> RC transmitter is recommended</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["FPV"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/d40858ff1ee5057f99f733c0f92c061a09b17733/ss_d40858ff1ee5057f99f733c0f92c061a09b17733.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762421506","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/d40858ff1ee5057f99f733c0f92c061a09b17733/ss_d40858ff1ee5057f99f733c0f92c061a09b17733.600x338.jpg?t=1762421506"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/d97d09e9ce54c995e9031728ceda364befe97056/ss_d97d09e9ce54c995e9031728ceda364befe97056.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762421506","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/d97d09e9ce54c995e9031728ceda364befe97056/ss_d97d09e9ce54c995e9031728ceda364befe97056.600x338.jpg?t=1762421506"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/1c30bc3fd23ec13d8505a8c49cc7492b4b6dadc8/ss_1c30bc3fd23ec13d8505a8c49cc7492b4b6dadc8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762421506","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a